DESCRIPTION:Migratory Birds from 10 to 11:30 a.m.\nPaynetown SRA\, Campgrou
 nd Playground\nDROP BY to learn about a couple of the migratory birds that
  fly south for the winter – but return to southern Indiana for the summe
 r to nest and raise their young. Discover how to help these birds and craf
 t your own “flapping” bird craft!
