BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Monroe Lake DNR
DTSTAMP:20260721T033020Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52887710204446
DTSTART:20260623T230000Z
DTEND:20260624T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:Explore Monroe Paddling Trip at 7:00 p.m.\n\nRegistration requi
 red by June 19.Trip fee is $15 per person.Limited to 10 people. Restricted
  to ages 16 and up. All participants must have at least 2 hours of prior p
 addling experience OR have completed one of our Beginner Kayaking workshop
 s.Bring your own canoe/kayak\, or rent a sit-on-top kayak (weight limit: 2
 75 pounds) for an additional $20.Location: Crooked Creek SRA\n\nExplore th
 e quieter side of Monroe Lake during these guided paddling trips that jour
 ney through backwaters\, wetlands\, bays\, and/or slow-moving streams. Tri
 ps highlight beautiful views\, hidden wildlife\, aquatic plants\, and uniq
 ue land features. Find your new favorite place to kayak! 2 hours \n\n \n\n
 REFUND/TRANSFER/CANCELLATION POLICY\n\nRegistrations are considered final 
 and no refunds or date transfers are available\, with limited exceptions. 
 You may transfer a registration(s) to another person(s) by contacting Jill
  Vance at jvance@dnr.IN.gov from the same email used in your original regi
 stration. Provide the name(s) and email(s) of the person to whom you want 
 to transfer the registration(s). Requests must be received at least 48 hou
 rs prior to the start of the workshop.In the event that the trip is cancel
 led by the instructor for weather\, low registration\, or instructor illne
 ss\, registered participants may opt to transfer their registration to ano
 ther Explore Monroe trip on a different date or receive a full refund. Wea
 ther Cancellation Policy: If only light rain is anticipated\, the trip wil
 l likely proceed as scheduled. However\, if there is a strong possibility 
 (as determined by the instructor) of moderate to heavy rain\, high winds\,
  or thunder/lightning\, the workshop will be cancelled for safety reasons.
  Any decision to cancel due to anticipated weather will be made at least 2
  hours prior to the trip start time. In the event of a cancellation\, an e
 mail notice will be sent to all registrants.Low Registration Policy: The t
 rip may be cancelled\, at the discretion of the instructor\, if there are 
 fewer than 3 people signed up by the registration deadline. If the trip is
  cancelled due to low registration\, all participants will be notified wit
 hin 24 hours of the close of registration.
GEO:39.092423;-86.423753
LOCATION:Monroe Lake\, Crooked Creek State Recreation Area (directions emai
 led to registrants prior to trip)
SUMMARY:Explore Monroe Paddling Trip\, Crooked Creek SRA (Monroe Lake)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.in.gov/event/explore-monroe-kayaking-trip-croo
 ked-creek-sra-monroe-lake
CATEGORIES:Events
END:VEVENT
