UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52887425106306
DTSTART:20260628T133000Z
DTEND:20260628T160000Z
DESCRIPTION:Beginner Kayaking Workshop at 9:30 a.m.\n\nRegistration require
 d by June 25.Cost is $20 per person.Limited to 9 people.Due to kayak and P
 FD safety restrictions\, participants must be at least 10 years of age and
  weigh no more than 275 pounds.Location: Cutright SRA\n\nIf you love seein
 g wildlife\, or just enjoy exploring\, kayaking is for you! Kayaks let you
  reach backwater areas and quiet bays that aren’t otherwise accessible\;
  it’s a wonderful way to experience Monroe Lake. \n\nThis 2.5 hour works
 hop is specifically designed for beginners with zero (or very little) padd
 ling experience. We’ll teach you basic paddling and safety skills and pr
 ovide supervised paddling time in a quiet water area to practice.\n\nKayak
 s\, paddles\, and life jackets are included in the class fee\; please do n
 ot bring your own. \n \n\nREFUND/TRANSFER/CANCELLATION POLICY\n\nRegistrat
 ions are considered final and no refunds or date transfers are available\,
  with limited exceptions. You may transfer a registration(s) to another pe
 rson(s) by contacting Jill Vance at jvance@dnr.IN.gov from the same email 
 used in your original registration. Provide the name(s) and email(s) of th
 e person to whom you want to transfer the registration(s). Requests must b
 e received at least 48 hours prior to the start of the workshop.In the eve
 nt that the workshop is cancelled by the instructor for weather\, low regi
 stration\, or instructor illness\, registered participants may opt to tran
 sfer their registration to the same workshop on a different date or receiv
 e a full refund. Weather Cancellation Policy: If only light rain is antici
 pated\, the workshop will likely proceed as scheduled. However\, if there 
 is a strong possibility (as determined by the instructor) of moderate to h
 eavy rain\, high winds\, or thunder/lightning\, the workshop will be cance
 lled for safety reasons. Any decision to cancel due to anticipated weather
  will be made at least 2 hours prior to the workshop start time. In the ev
 ent of a cancellation\, an email notice will be sent to all registrants.Lo
 w Registration Policy: The workshop may be cancelled\, at the discretion o
 f the instructor\, if there are fewer than 3 people signed up by the regis
 tration deadline. If the workshop is cancelled due to low registration\, a
 ll participants will be notified within 24 hours of the close of registrat
 ion.
GEO:39.092423;-86.423753
LOCATION:Monroe Lake\, Cutright State Recreation Area
SUMMARY:Beginner Kayaking Workshop\, Cutright SRA (Monroe Lake)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.in.gov/event/beginner-kayaking-workshop-cutrig
 ht-sra-monroe-lake-5991
CATEGORIES:Events
END:VEVENT
