DTSTAMP:20260721T033021Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53312876323403
DTSTART:20260805T130000Z
DTEND:20260805T140000Z
DESCRIPTION:Flora Field Day at 9:00 a.m.\n\n•    Sign up for this session
  at tinyurl.com/florafielddays \n•    Registration required by August 3.
 \n•    Free\; recommended for ages 12 and up.\n•    Session location: 
 Moores Creek SRA\n\nWant to work on your flora identification skills? Prac
 tice with a naturalist! Field day emphasis is on proper use and applicatio
 n of an ID key\, which opens the door to identifying thousands of species.
  The naturalist will work with each attendee based on their prior experien
 ce. If you’ve never worked with flower ID before\, this is a great way t
 o learn. If you have prior experience\, this is a fun way to practice your
  skills (and maybe add some new blooms to your life list!). 2 hours\n\nThi
 ngs to Bring:\n•    Newcomb’s Wildflower Guide (extra copies available
 \, if you don’t have your own)\n•    bug spray (long pants are also a 
 good idea!)\n•    hat and sunglasses (for sun protection)\n•    water 
 bottle (pre-filled)\n•    camera (if you’re the picture-taking type)
GEO:39.092423;-86.423753
LOCATION:Monroe Lake\, Moores Creek SRA - directions will be emailed after 
 registration ends
SUMMARY:Flora Field Day\, Moores Creek SRA (Monroe Lake)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.in.gov/event/flora-field-day-moores-creek-sra-
 monroe-lake-6218
CATEGORIES:Events
END:VEVENT
