DTEND:20260809T143000Z
DESCRIPTION:Beginner Kayaking Workshop at 9:30 a.m.\n\nRegistration require
 d by August 6.Cost is $20 per person.Limited to 9 people.Due to kayak and 
 PFD safety restrictions\, participants must be at least 10 years of age an
 d weigh no more than 275 pounds.Location: Cutright SRA\n\nIf you love seei
 ng wildlife\, or just enjoy exploring\, kayaking is for you! Kayaks let yo
 u reach backwater areas and quiet bays that aren’t otherwise accessible\
 ; it’s a wonderful way to experience Monroe Lake. \n\nThis 2.5 hour work
 shop is specifically designed for beginners with zero (or very little) pad
 dling experience. We’ll teach you basic paddling and safety skills and p
 rovide supervised paddling time in a quiet water area to practice.\n\nKaya
 ks\, paddles\, and life jackets are included in the class fee\; please do 
 not bring your own. \n \n\nREFUND/TRANSFER/CANCELLATION POLICY\n\nRegistra
 tions are considered final and no refunds or date transfers are available\
 , with limited exceptions. You may transfer a registration(s) to another p
 erson(s) by contacting Jill Vance at jvance@dnr.IN.gov from the same email
  used in your original registration. Provide the name(s) and email(s) of t
 he person to whom you want to transfer the registration(s). Requests must 
 be received at least 48 hours prior to the start of the workshop.In the ev
 ent that the workshop is cancelled by the instructor for weather\, low reg
 istration\, or instructor illness\, registered participants may opt to tra
 nsfer their registration to the same workshop on a different date or recei
 ve a full refund. Weather Cancellation Policy: If only light rain is antic
 ipated\, the workshop will likely proceed as scheduled. However\, if there
  is a strong possibility (as determined by the instructor) of moderate to 
 heavy rain\, high winds\, or thunder/lightning\, the workshop will be canc
 elled for safety reasons. Any decision to cancel due to anticipated weathe
 r will be made at least 2 hours prior to the workshop start time. In the e
 vent of a cancellation\, an email notice will be sent to all registrants.L
 ow Registration Policy: The workshop may be cancelled\, at the discretion 
 of the instructor\, if there are fewer than 3 people signed up by the regi
 stration deadline. If the workshop is cancelled due to low registration\, 
 all participants will be notified within 24 hours of the close of registra
 tion.
GEO:39.092423;-86.423753
LOCATION:Monroe Lake\, Cutright State Recreation Area
SUMMARY:Beginner Kayaking Workshop\, Cutright SRA (Monroe Lake)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.in.gov/event/beginner-kayaking-workshop-cutrig
 ht-sra-monroe-lake-9960
CATEGORIES:Events
END:VEVENT
